  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 522.06 Termination of Program",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 522.06 Termination of Program.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 261-B:3, II, a program may voluntarily end its participation in the multi-use decal program by:\n\n(1) Written notification to the director of motor vehicles; and\n\n(2) Filing a final annual report within 30 days of the notification.\n\n(b) Pursuant to RSA 261-B:3, III, participation in the multi-use decal program shall terminate automatically if:\n\n(1) The organization fails to file its annual report under RSA 261-B:3, I; or\n\n(2) The organization fails to include the statement required by RSA 261-B:3, 1(h).\n\nSource. #12914, eff 11-6-19; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 523.06)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
